## Q32 root cause audit

**Fix scope = 6 file changes + 1 spec + 1 backlog**:

1. **`Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Agent/MiniMaxModel.swift`** — add `tier` field to `Provider` struct
   - New enum `ModelTier: String, Codable { case ultra, med }`
   - `Provider` struct: add `var tier: ModelTier?` (optional = legacy models without tier)
   - Curate `defaultModels` to 5 = `[m3ultra, m27med, m2_5med, m2_1med, m2med]`
   - Or keep 8 default + curate via `curatedModels` computed property

2. **`Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Provider/ProviderCatalog.swift`** — update model names
   - Rename: `MiniMax-M3` → `MiniMax M3 Ultra`
   - Rename: `MiniMax-M2.7` → `MiniMax M2.7 Med`
   - Rename: `MiniMax-M2.5` → `MiniMax M2.5 Med`
   - Rename: `MiniMax-M2.1` → `MiniMax M2.1 Med`
   - Rename: `MiniMax-M2` → `MiniMax M2 Med`
   - Delete: M2.7-highspeed, M2.5-highspeed, M2.1-highspeed, M2-her (5 → 4 dropped, -highspeed variants not in hermes 5)

3. **`Sources/WenshuApp/State/ChatSettings.swift`** (NEW FILE) — chat settings store
   - `@MainActor` `class ChatSettings: ObservableObject`
   - `@Published var thinkingEnabled: Bool` (default false, persisted via `@AppStorage("wenshu.thinking")`)
   - `@Published var reasoningEffort: ReasoningEffort` (default `.ultra`, persisted)
   - `enum ReasoningEffort: String, Codable, CaseIterable { case minimal, low, medium, high, veryHigh, max, ultra }`
   - Display label: minimal="最小", low="低", medium="中", high="高", veryHigh="极高", max="最高", ultra="超高"

4. **`Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Agent/MiniMaxVerifier.swift`** — add `thinking` + `reasoning_effort` to `MiniMaxRequest`
   ```swift
   public struct ThinkingConfig: Codable, Sendable {
       public let type: String  // "enabled"
       public let budget_tokens: Int?
   }
   public struct MiniMaxRequest: Codable, Sendable {
       public let model: String
       public let max_tokens: Int
       public let messages: [MiniMaxMessage]
       public let thinking: ThinkingConfig?
       public let reasoning_effort: String?  // "low" / "medium" / "high"
   }
   ```
   - Update init + encoder

5. **`Sources/WenshuApp/Views/Chat/ChatView.swift`** + **`Sources/WenshuApp/Views/Settings/SettingsView.swift`** — settings UI panel
   - Settings tab "模型" or new ChatSettings tab:
     - 思考 Toggle (`.toggle(...)`)
     - 推理强度 `Picker(selection, label: Text("推理强度")) { ForEach(ReasoningEffort.allCases, id: ...) { ... } }`
     - Selected model display = `"{name} · {tier}"` (e.g. `MiniMax M3 · Ultra`)
   - Refresh model button = `Button("刷新模型") { Task { await refreshModels() } }`
   - Edit model... button = sheet with `@AppStorage("wenshu.customModels")` JSON array

6. **`Sources/WenshuApp/App.swift`** ChatZoneView — wire ChatSettings into MiniMaxVerifier calls
   - When constructing `MiniMaxRequest`, set `thinking` + `reasoning_effort` from `ChatSettings`

